<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<title>监控报告 · {{.View.Name}} · {{.Filters}}</title>
<style>
:root { --ok:#16a34a; --fail:#dc2626; --timeout:#d97706; --stale:#ea580c; --unknown:#6b7280; --manual:#0891b2; --slow:#ca8a04; }
* { box-sizing: border-box; }
body { margin:0; padding:28px 36px 40px; color:#1f2328; background:#fff;
  font:14px/1.5 -apple-system,"Segoe UI","Microsoft YaHei","PingFang SC",sans-serif; max-width:880px; margin-inline:auto; }
h1 { font-size:19px; margin:0 0 2px; }
h2 { font-size:15px; margin:26px 0 10px; border-left:4px solid #2563eb; padding-left:8px; }
.meta { color:#6a737d; font-size:12px; margin-bottom:4px; }
.badge { display:inline-block; padding:2px 12px; border-radius:999px; font-size:13px; border:1px solid transparent; }
.badge.ok { background:#dcfce7; color:var(--ok); }
.badge.fail { background:#fee2e2; color:var(--fail); }
.badge.stale { background:#ffedd5; color:var(--stale); }
.badge.unknown, .badge.disabled { background:#e5e7eb; color:var(--unknown); }
.badge.manual_only { background:#cffafe; color:var(--manual); }
.slow { color:var(--slow); font-size:12px; margin-left:6px; }
.cards { display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:10px; }
.card { border:1px solid #e2e4e8; border-radius:8px; padding:8px 14px; min-width:118px; }
.card.wide { flex:1 1 100%; }
.card.wide .v { font-size:14px; font-weight:500; overflow-wrap:anywhere; }
.card .v { font-size:17px; font-weight:600; }
.card .l { color:#6a737d; font-size:12px; }
.v.c-ok { color:var(--ok); } .v.c-timeout { color:var(--timeout); } .v.c-error { color:var(--fail); }
.note { color:#6a737d; font-size:12px; }
svg { display:block; width:100%; height:auto; border:1px solid #eef0f2; border-radius:8px; }
svg text { font-size:10px; fill:#6a737d; }
svg .grid { stroke:#eef0f2; }
svg .ln.ok { fill:none; stroke:var(--ok); stroke-width:1.8; }
svg .ln.total { fill:none; stroke:var(--manual); stroke-width:1.8; }
svg .ln.ttft { fill:none; stroke:#2563eb; stroke-width:1.8; }
svg .leg { font-size:11px; }
svg .c-total { fill:var(--manual); } svg .c-ttft { fill:#2563eb; }
.nodata { color:#6a737d; text-align:center; padding:48px 0; border:1px dashed #e2e4e8; border-radius:8px; }
table { border-collapse:collapse; width:100%; font-size:12.5px; }
th,td { border-bottom:1px solid #eef0f2; padding:5px 8px; text-align:left; white-space:nowrap; }
th { color:#6a737d; font-weight:500; font-size:12px; }
td.wrap { white-space:normal; overflow-wrap:anywhere; max-width:300px; }
tr.r-ok td.st { color:var(--ok); }
tr.r-fail td.st { color:var(--fail); }
tr.r-timeout td.st { color:var(--timeout); }
footer { margin-top:28px; color:#9aa0a6; font-size:11.5px; border-top:1px solid #eef0f2; padding-top:10px; }
@media print { body { padding:0; } }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<h1>LLM 接口可用性监控报告</h1>
<div class="meta">对象：<b>{{.View.Name}}</b> · 模型 {{.View.Model}} · 目标 {{.View.BaseURL}}</div>
<div class="meta">生成时间：{{.GeneratedAt}} · 过滤条件：{{.Filters}}{{if .TargetSnap}} · 探测目标快照：{{.TargetSnap}}{{end}}</div>

<h2>监测状态</h2>
{{if .View.LastProbe}}
<span class="badge {{.MonitorClass}}">{{.MonitorText}}</span>{{if and (eq .MonitorClass "ok") .SlowTTFT}}<span class="slow">可用，但首内容较慢</span>{{end}}{{if ge .View.StreakFail 2}}<span class="badge fail">连败 {{.View.StreakFail}}</span>{{end}}
<div class="meta" style="margin-top:6px">最近有效定时探测：{{statusTextOf .View.LastProbe.Status}} · {{fmtTimeOf .View.LastProbe.FinishedAt}} · TTFT {{fmtMsOf .View.LastProbe.TTFTMs}} · 总耗时 {{fmtMsOf .View.LastProbe.TotalMs}}</div>
{{else}}
<span class="badge {{.MonitorClass}}">{{.MonitorText}}</span>
<div class="meta" style="margin-top:6px">当前目标版本尚无有效的定时探测结果。</div>
{{end}}

<h2>统计（{{.Filters}}）</h2>
<div class="cards">
  <div class="card"><div class="v">{{.Stats.Samples}}</div><div class="l">样本数</div></div>
  <div class="card"><div class="v c-ok">{{fmtPctOf .Stats.OKPct}}</div><div class="l">成功率（{{.Stats.OK}}）</div></div>
  <div class="card"><div class="v c-timeout">{{fmtPctOf .Stats.TimeoutPct}}</div><div class="l">超时率（{{.Stats.Timeout}}）</div></div>
  <div class="card"><div class="v c-error">{{fmtPctOf .Stats.ErrorPct}}</div><div class="l">错误率（{{.Stats.ErrorCount}}）</div></div>
  <div class="card"><div class="v">{{fmtMsOf .Stats.AvgTTFTMs}}</div><div class="l">平均 TTFT（成功）</div></div>
  <div class="card"><div class="v">{{fmtMsOf .Stats.TTFTP50Ms}} / {{fmtMsOf .Stats.TTFTP95Ms}}</div><div class="l">TTFT P50 / P95（成功）</div></div>
  <div class="card"><div class="v">{{fmtMsOf .Stats.TotalP50Ms}} / {{fmtMsOf .Stats.TotalP95Ms}}</div><div class="l">总耗时 P50 / P95（成功）</div></div>
  <div class="card"><div class="v">{{fmtFlipOf .Stats.FlipRate}}</div><div class="l">抖动（结果翻转率）</div></div>
  <div class="card"><div class="v">{{fmtMsOf .Stats.AvgTotalMs}}</div><div class="l">平均总耗时（成功）</div></div>
  <div class="card"><div class="v">{{fmtTPSOf .Stats.AvgDecodeTPS}}</div><div class="l">decode 吞吐（成功）</div></div>
  <div class="card"><div class="v">{{fmtTPOTOf .Stats.AvgDecodeTPS}}</div><div class="l">TPOT（成功）</div></div>
  <div class="card"><div class="v">{{fmtTPSOf .Stats.AvgPrefillTPS}}</div><div class="l">prefill 吞吐（近似）</div></div>
  {{if .Stats.ErrorsByKind}}<div class="card wide"><div class="v">{{fmtErrKinds .Stats.ErrorsByKind}}</div><div class="l">错误分布</div></div>{{end}}
</div>
{{if eq .Stats.Samples 0}}<div class="note" style="margin-top:8px">暂无样本：该时间窗与目标版本下没有符合条件的定时探测记录，比例留空不显示 0%。</div>{{end}}

<h2>成功率趋势</h2>
{{.OKChart}}

<h2>成功请求耗时趋势（均值）</h2>
{{.LatencyChart}}

<h2>探测明细（最近 {{len .Rows}} 条{{if .Truncated}}，已截断至 {{reportMaxRows}} 条{{end}}）</h2>
{{if .Rows}}
<table>
<thead><tr><th>开始时间</th><th>来源</th><th>结果</th><th>状态</th><th>TTFT</th><th>总耗时</th><th>HTTP</th><th>Token（p/c）</th><th>错误 / 说明</th></tr></thead>
<tbody>
{{range .Rows}}<tr class="{{.RowClass}}">
  <td>{{.Time}}</td><td>{{.Source}}</td><td class="st">{{.ResultIcon}}</td><td class="st">{{.StatusText}}</td>
  <td>{{.TTFT}}</td><td>{{.Total}}</td><td>{{.HTTP}}</td><td>{{.Tokens}}</td><td class="wrap">{{.Error}}</td>
</tr>{{end}}
</tbody>
</table>
{{else}}
<div class="nodata">暂无记录</div>
{{end}}

<footer>
由 llm-monitor 本地面板导出的时点快照 · 统计口径与面板一致：分母为已完成、非主动取消的定时探测；手动与取消记录仅列示，不计入比例 · 本报告不包含 API Key 与输出片段。
</footer>

</body>
</html>
